@@ -20,6 +20,8 @@ Messages, files, profiles and the setup messages of voice connections are encryp
 
 **Friends and direct messages.** Users can send each other friend requests by username, accept them and block people. Messages from a blocked person in text rooms are collapsed and their voice is muted on your side.
 
+**Moving between conversations.** Room, direct message and Friends switches are written to the browser history and the address does not change. The back button of the browser and the phone works at every width: it first closes an open sheet, search, settings, the image viewer or the profile card, then returns to the previous conversation. When a conversation with unread messages opens, a New messages divider is placed in front of the first unread message and brought into view, and the bar at the top shows the unread count, the time of the first unread message and the Jump to Unread and Mark as Read buttons. The unread count drops when you reach the bottom, not when you enter the room. A message that arrives while you are scrolled up does not scroll you down, and the pill at the bottom says "1 new message below" and takes you to the bottom when pressed. Direct conversations sit in the Direct messages group of the Stations list and sheet, unread ones first. On narrow screens and phones the Direct Messages button in the top bar opens this group, and on wide screens it opens the newest conversation with unread messages. When the page reloads, the open room, direct conversation or Friends view comes back. Read marks are kept only on that device.
+
 **Forgot my password.** A 28 character recovery code is shown when the account is created. The code can be copied or downloaded as a file, and it can be created again, renewed or removed with the password in Settings > My Account. A person who forgets their password sets a new one with the code via the Forgot My Password link on the sign in screen. The security key does not change, old direct messages stay readable, and a new code is issued once the code is used. A person without a code is pointed to the frequency owner, and old direct messages can no longer be read after the owner's password reset. Telsiz does not use email.
 
 **Profile.** Settings > Profile sets the display name, custom status, about me text, profile color, profile picture and cover photo. The profile picture is center-cropped to a square and re-encoded at 256x256, the cover photo is center-cropped to 3:1 and re-encoded at 1200x400, and metadata such as the location is removed. The profile details and both images are end-to-end encrypted and only members with the encryption key can see them. The cover appears in the color band of the profile card and is downloaded only when the card is opened, so the server can see who opens whose card.
